Subject: config.sub: accept substrate as an OS name

Standard one-line config.sub registration so triples like
i386-unknown-substrate are recognised at configure time.

---
--- a/build-aux/config.sub	2026-09-27 23:36:05.047060063 -0500
+++ b/build-aux/config.sub	2026-09-27 23:36:06.992061344 -0500
@@ -1396,6 +1396,7 @@
 	      | -interix* | -uwin* | -mks* | -rhapsody* | -darwin* | -opened* \
 	      | -openstep* | -oskit* | -conix* | -pw32* | -nonstopux* \
 	      | -storm-chaos* | -tops10* | -tenex* | -tops20* | -its* \
+	      | -substrate* \
 	      | -os2* | -vos* | -palmos* | -uclinux* | -nucleus* \
 	      | -morphos* | -superux* | -rtmk* | -rtmk-nova* | -windiss* \
 	      | -powermax* | -dnix* | -nx6 | -nx7 | -sei* | -dragonfly* \
